==Geography==
===Climate===
The climate of Qym varies from [[wikipedia:Oceanic climate|oceanic]] (Cfb) in the south to [[wikipedia:Humid_continental_climate#Warm_summer_subtype|continental]] (Dfb) for most of the country. [[wikipedia:Subarctic climate|Subarctic climate]] (Dfc) is found at the very north and [[wikipedia:Tundra climate|tundra]] (ET) in the [[MOUNTAINS]]. 

===Hydrology===
The [[Foldava]] is the main river. The [[Mizhpy]] is its most significant tributary and meets the Foldava in the capital city of [[Zhol]]. 

