===Fauna and flora===
The vegetation transitions from [[wikipedia:Temperate broadleaf and mixed forests|temperate broadleaf and mixed forests]] in the south and central regions, and gradually decreases towards the north, passing from [[wikipedia:taiga|boreal forest]] to [[wikipedia:tundra|tundra]] and finally to the arid soils of the Far North, devoid of vegetation. Alpine areas, such as in the [[March of Qarhõ]] in the south, also feature mountainous vegetation and [[wikipedia:alpine tundra|alpine tundra]]. 

